; QuantumEdge — GBPUSD M30 Daytrading (DD <4% tuned)
; GBPUSD is ~1.4x EURUSD volatility — wider ATR, higher spread, fewer bars/day (48)
; Test: M30 Every tick, Spread 18-25, 2022-2025, 0.8-1.2% risk
; Expected (walk-forward): PF 1.4-1.8, win 52-58%, DD 3.5-6%, trades 3-6/day
; News: Add GBP to filter (EUR,USD,GBP) and keep manual 45m before / 30m after

